          "abridged": false,
          "author": "Various",
          "description": "Sony Pictures Animation, the studio behind Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse and KPop Demon Hunters, presents GOAT, an original action-comedy set in an all-animal world. The soundtrack is packed with genre-spanning stars, from Jelly Roll with the anthemic “I’m Good” to FLO turning up the confidence on “Mamacitas.” The soundtrack also features high-energy moments from Jon Bellion & Ayra Starr, Trueno, Quinn XCII, Bryant Barnes, and more!",
